      "title": "TEAM GUIDE | both routes are retained",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Qwen makes a short reference; LongCat speaks the FINAL SCRIPT. The shared reference words feed both nodes.\n\nChanging only the LongCat script reuses the Qwen reference while it stays cached. Keep the Qwen seed fixed. Change its seed to design a different voice.\n\nFor durable campaign reuse, keep the approved Qwen WAV + script.txt. Open Zura_LongCat_Voice_Clone.json next time and load that WAV; no Qwen run is needed.\n\nLongCat is a new performance, not an enhancement. Use English or Chinese for the LongCat route."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Qwen makes a short reference; LongCat speaks the FINAL SCRIPT. The shared reference words feed both nodes.\n\nChanging only the LongCat script reuses the Qwen reference while it stays cached. Keep the Qwen seed fixed. Change its seed to design a different voice.\n\nFor durable campaign reuse, keep the approved Qwen WAV + script.txt. Open Zura_LongCat_Voice_Clone.json next time and load that WAV; no Qwen run is needed.\n\nLongCat is a new performance, not an enhancement. Use English or Chinese for the LongCat route."
      },
